    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.poster.avif?t=1746014256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.webm?t=1746014256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.mp4?t=1746014256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the game about:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to AI Asylum</i>,</strong> a haunting asylum teeming with enigmatic individuals who guard their secrets with an iron grip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your mission? </i></strong>Earn the trust of the enigmatic female special agent, Nora, the mystic cat girl, Mio, and other patients as you delve into their deepest, most sinister truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you need to do is explore the scenes of the character, then find key items, and obtain crucial information by conversing with the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This information can assist you in completing the task.<strong><i> But beware,</i></strong> not everyone is as they appear, and peril lurks around every corner, inappropriate questions or actions may provoke the character and result in mission failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/755eb5c8db3d8c37e9322d6eac4a5df1.avif?t=1746014256\" width=720 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>AI-powered puzzle duels:</i></strong> Alone in a dark room, you'll face off against characters with unique personalities. Solve intricate puzzles and outsmart them in a battle of wits to escape with your life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>AI Character Editor:</i></strong> Craft your own unique personas. Choose from a wide array of models and environments to bring your chilling narrative to life, then share your meticulously designed characters with fellow adventurers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dive into Storylines:</i></strong>\u00a0Get ready to dive deep into the lives of your favorite characters and experience their thrilling stories like never before. Discover the all-new personal tales of Nora, Mio, John, Witch Sources, and the Puppet Princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/6fd42d65922da0d9fe555df438f57d6b.avif?t=1746014256\" width=720 height=216 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.poster.avif?t=1746014256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.webm?t=1746014256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/8701f52e481fabda927657613ba6d6fc.mp4?t=1746014256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the game about:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to AI Asylum</i>,</strong> a haunting asylum teeming with enigmatic individuals who guard their secrets with an iron grip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your mission? </i></strong>Earn the trust of the enigmatic female special agent, Nora, the mystic cat girl, Mio, and other patients as you delve into their deepest, most sinister truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you need to do is explore the scenes of the character, then find key items, and obtain crucial information by conversing with the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This information can assist you in completing the task.<strong><i> But beware,</i></strong> not everyone is as they appear, and peril lurks around every corner, inappropriate questions or actions may provoke the character and result in mission failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/755eb5c8db3d8c37e9322d6eac4a5df1.avif?t=1746014256\" width=720 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>AI-powered puzzle duels:</i></strong> Alone in a dark room, you'll face off against characters with unique personalities. Solve intricate puzzles and outsmart them in a battle of wits to escape with your life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>AI Character Editor:</i></strong> Craft your own unique personas. Choose from a wide array of models and environments to bring your chilling narrative to life, then share your meticulously designed characters with fellow adventurers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dive into Storylines:</i></strong>\u00a0Get ready to dive deep into the lives of your favorite characters and experience their thrilling stories like never before. Discover the all-new personal tales of Nora, Mio, John, Witch Sources, and the Puppet Princess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282930/extras/6fd42d65922da0d9fe555df438f57d6b.avif?t=1746014256\" width=720 height=216 /></span></h2>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a realm of madness and bone-chilling terror as you step into our gripping horror adventure, meticulously crafted to send shivers down your spine. Explore a nightmarish world where each step unveils sinister secrets and heart-pounding encounters.",
